WEBVTT

00:04:29.932 --> 00:04:32.977
From DJ Jubilee and Cash Money
Records in New Orleans,

00:04:32.977 --> 00:04:33.978
to Lil Jon

00:04:33.978 --> 00:04:35.688
and the Ying Yang Twins in Atlanta,

00:04:35.688 --> 00:04:37.315
to Uncle Luke in Miami,

00:04:37.315 --> 00:04:40.776
twerking was alive and well
in nearly every Black club in the South.

00:04:41.319 --> 00:04:43.946
But it would take years
after these songs were released

00:04:43.946 --> 00:04:46.157
for twerking to finally become mainstream.

00:04:47.074 --> 00:04:48.242
I got a test for y’all.

00:04:49.201 --> 00:04:52.204
(Singing) Uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh oh, no, no.

00:04:52.204 --> 00:04:54.707
Uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh, oh, no, no.

00:04:54.832 --> 00:04:55.833
You know that one?

00:04:55.875 --> 00:04:56.876
Hold up.

00:04:56.917 --> 00:04:57.918
Ya’ll ain’t see it.

00:04:58.919 --> 00:05:03.924
(Singing) Uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh oh, no, no,
uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh, oh, no, no.